      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "COOL HEART (5) looks a top chance. Turned in an eye catching run fresh and has placed 4/5 when second-up. Meets the winner much better at the weights and leading rider stays aboard. Go close. Beating her was THE REAL MAN (3) who tracked the speed and ran on to score by a length. More weight but racing well here and looks a leading player to go back to back. HUBUBBAJAHN (10) placed fresh then wasn't far away when fifth last time. Best form measures up and she looks a huge chance. WILD NIGHTS (8) won two on end before placing here last time. Has placed 2/4 course and distance. Flying lately and must be included. BAYBOUGG (2) is drawn for a good trail and can sneak into the finish fresh.",
